{"version":1,"key":"card:454","content":{"id":454,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在错误条件出现时立即崩溃胜过以后再崩溃"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"（开发时解 bug 总比上线出现问题解 bug 好）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"断言是一种有效的调试工具，用于验证编程过程中的假设。通过在代码中插入断言语句，可以快速检查程序的状态是否如预期，并能够帮助开发人员快速发现问题。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"assert condition, message","language":"py","uuid":"0a5af33f-633a-45f9-b0e5-c898c0c015c2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"condition","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：一个可以是任何返回布尔值的表达式。如果条件为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"False","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则触发断言错误"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"message","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：可选项，用于指定断言失败时显示的错误消息"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当断言的条件为假时，会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"AssertionError","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 异常，从而帮助开发人员调试程序并识别问题所在"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> age = 10\n>>> assert 0 < age < 100\n\n>>> age = -1\n>>> assert 0 < age < 100\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nAssertionError","language":"py","uuid":"8697cb80-9cc8-4257-971c-112435995818","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> age = -1\n>>> assert 0 < age < 100, 'The age must be realistic'\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nAssertionError: The age must be realistic","language":"py","uuid":"cd788896-823a-41f8-a6bc-617859be0210","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Python/断言"],"createTime":1719189959873,"updateTime":1743303640441,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640441}}